---

<section class="featured-insights-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="label">Our Thinking</span>
      <h2>Models for the Modern Age</h2>
      <p>We share our strongest thinking before we sell our services. These are the models guiding our work right now.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="insights-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: System (Priya) -->
      <a href="/rabbit-holes/building-intelligence/" class="insight-card featured">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="tag">System</span>
          <span class="date">New Release</span>
        </div>
        <h3>The Door Mouse Who Saved the World</h3>
        <p>How to build an internal intelligence agency ("Room 40") that turns raw data into courageous action.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="link-text">Explore the system →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 2: Tools (Marcus/Sarah) -->
      <a href="/insights/greenhouse/" class="insight-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="tag">Culture</span>
          <span class="date">Interactive Tool</span>
        </div>
        <h3>The Greenhouse</h3>
        <p>A suite of diagnostic tools to measure psychological safety and pilot cultural change in 90 days.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="link-text">Use the tools →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3: Clarity (Emma) -->
      <a href="/rabbit-holes/signal-from-noise/" class="insight-card">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="tag">Clarity</span>
          <span class="date">Methodology</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Signal From Noise</h3>
        <p>How to stop drowning in content and start curating wisdom. The antidote to the Golden Age of Noise.</p>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="link-text">Read the theory →</span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .featured-insights-section {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
    background: #0a0a0a;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .insights-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .insight-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-left: 1px solid #333;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .insight-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    background: #161616;
  }

  .insight-card.featured {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.05) 0%, #111 50%);
  }

  .card-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .tag {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .date {
    color: #666;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .insight-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #aaa;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .link-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .insight-card:hover .link-text {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
